[0.000, "o", "\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NAME THE CAUSE\r\n  planted cause: Paid traffic fell after the spring campaign ended on 14 June. Conversion was unchanged; the drop is volume, not quality.\r\n  decoys placed to mislead: deploy, onboarding, conversion rate\r\n  signals a correct answer names: campaign\r\n"]
